machine_wiki:
A remake of the Bally classic, Fathom, was announced by Haggis Pinball on April 26, 2021.

Manufacturing was scheduled to begin on July 1st,  2021, with the plan to build 50 per month. The first machine was delivered on May 13th, 2022.

Two editions of Fathom 'Revisited' will be built as part of the Haggis Classic Series
Classic Edition ($9,500 AUD  ($10450 incl. Australian GST)/ $7,360 USD) 
and 
Mermaid Edition ($11,500 AUD ($12650 incl. Australian GST) / $8,900 USD).

The Mermaid Edition has various add-ons & enhancements, such as;
A new rule package with callouts and music; 
Enhanced LED lighting; 
Mirrored trim;
RGB Seven Segment Displays;
Apron LCD screens.
